B3 meldet **1 = Magazin leer**. Hänge also an das Einschalten von 2Y1 die Bedingung `NOT "B3"` – oder schalte 2Y1 einfach aus, solange B3 = 1:

```
IF "B3" THEN
    "_2Y1" := FALSE;
END_IF;
```

Ein Datenbaustein `"Alt"` mit `S1` … `S5 : Bool`, Taktmerker auf MB0, dann:

```
IF "S1" AND NOT "Alt".S1 THEN "_1Y1" := NOT "_1Y1"; END_IF;
IF "S2" AND NOT "Alt".S2 THEN
    "_3Y1" := NOT "_3Y1";
    IF "_3Y1" THEN "_3Y2" := FALSE; END_IF;
END_IF;
IF "S3" AND NOT "Alt".S3 THEN
    "_3Y2" := NOT "_3Y2";
    IF "_3Y2" THEN "_3Y1" := FALSE; END_IF;
END_IF;
IF "S4" AND NOT "Alt".S4 THEN
    "_2Y2" := NOT "_2Y2";
    IF "_2Y2" THEN "_2Y1" := FALSE; END_IF;
END_IF;
IF "S5" AND NOT "Alt".S5 THEN
    "_2Y1" := NOT "_2Y1";
    IF "_2Y1" THEN "_2Y2" := FALSE; END_IF;
END_IF;
IF "B3" THEN "_2Y1" := FALSE; END_IF;
"Alt".S1 := "S1"; "Alt".S2 := "S2"; "Alt".S3 := "S3";
"Alt".S4 := "S4"; "Alt".S5 := "S5";
"P1" := NOT "B3" OR %M0.3;
```
